      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Before combat begins, you must place your heroes on the battlefield. Click
    <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>(M1)</color></font-weight> on a character to
    select them, then click <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>(M1)</color></font-weight>
    on any green starting tile to place them.

    Positioning matters. Frontline
    fighters should protect vulnerable allies, while ranged heroes benefit from distance
    and clear lines of sight. You may freely reposition characters during this phase.
    There is no penalty for experimentation.

    When all characters are placed
    and you are satisfied with your formation, press <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Spacebar</color></font-weight>
    or click <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Start Combat</color></font-weight> to
    begin.'
