      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The shop offers {card}individual cards{/card}, as well as {card}card packs{/card}.

    {card}Card
    packs{/card} allow you to <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>select two</color></font-weight>
    {card}cards{/card} from a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>set of five</color></font-weight>,
    offering strategic choice mixed with randomness.

    You may also pay to <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>refresh
    the shop</color></font-weight>. Refreshing fully <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>restocks</color></font-weight>
    the shop, replacing all current offerings, including any items you have already
    purchase, with a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>new random selection</color></font-weight>
    of characters, {card}cards{/card}, and packs.'
