  m_text: "This is the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Info Panel</color></font-weight>,
    here you\u2019ll find the character\u2019s name, class, traits, stats and all
    status effects currently affecting them.\r\nEvery character has:\r\n \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One
    positive trait</color></font-weight>\r\n \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One
    negative trait</color></font-weight>\r\nTraits can modify stats, alter {ability}ability{/ability}
    behavior, or introduce conditional effects.\r\nClass-specific traits are more
    rare and often more powerful positive traits, shaping unique playstyles.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
