  m_text: 'Combat is viewed through a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>3D strategic
    camera</color></font-weight> designed to clearly communicate unit positions,
    threats, and terrain without unnecessary complexity.

    You can move the camera
    to survey the battlefield using WASD or holding down Mouse Scroll Wheel.

    Adjust
    your view by <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>scrolling the Mouse Scroll Wheel</color></font-weight>
    to zoom in and out within a limited range.'
