  m_text: 'Hovering over an {ability}ability{/ability} opens its tooltip, displaying
    detailed information. If you hover over a tooltip <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>long
    enough</color></font-weight>, it will <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>lock in
    place</color></font-weight>, allowing you to move the cursor freely and inspect
    additional details without the tooltip disappearing. The hover time required
    to lock a tooltip can be <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>adjusted in the Settings
    Menu</color></font-weight>.

    Highlighted <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>keywords</color></font-weight>
    inside tooltips can be hovered over to reveal deeper explanations of mechanics
    such as Buffs, Debuffs, or special rules. Mastering keywords is essential for
    understanding more complex interactions.

    {physical_damage}Damage{/physical_damage}
    values shown in {ability}abilities{/ability} can also be hovered over to see
    the full {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage} calculation, including modifiers
    from stats, traits, and active effects. '
