  m_text: "The Combat Log records what happens in the battle, including <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>effects
    applied</color></font-weight> to characters, {physical_damage}damage dealt{/physical_damage},
    {heal}healing done{/heal}, {card}cards used{/card}, and character <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>deaths</color></font-weight>.\r\nClicking
