      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Between combats, you may manage your party here.\r\nYou can:\r\n \u2022
    Recruit new characters\r\n \u2022 Sell existing ones\r\n \u2022 {heal}Heal{/heal}
    your party\r\n \u2022 Inspect characters in detail via the Info Panel\r\nCharacters
    offered in the shop are <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>generated with some randomness</color></font-weight>,
    meaning their <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>stats and traits may vary</color></font-weight>.
    Keep an eye out for characters whose stats and traits best fit your current strategy.
    Striving to have a full party of characters as soon as possible is recommended."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6bd24cd4d3d515d48bd7ad1def33fa09, type: 2}
