      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "{ability}Abilities{/ability} are a character\u2019s primary tools in combat.
    A character may use one {ability}ability{/ability} per turn.\r\nA character can
    only <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>move before</color></font-weight> using
    an {ability}ability{/ability}, unless the {ability}ability{/ability} explicitly
    states otherwise. \r\nEach class has four unique {ability}abilities{/ability},
    defining their role on the battlefield.\r\n{ability}Abilities{/ability} may:\r\n
    \u2022 Deal {physical_damage}damage{/physical_damage} or {heal}heal{/heal}\r\n
    \u2022 Affect a single target or characters in a larger area\r\n \u2022 Apply
    or remove buffs or debuffs"
